DTEND:20260515T003000Z
SUMMARY:[PUBLIC] Compost Program Drop-In
LOCATION:The Growers Lot
DESCRIPTION:New to composting? Start here. We will walk the whole pile toge
 ther — what goes in\, what absolutely does not\, how to tell when it is coo
 king\, and how to fix one that has gone sour and slimy. You will leave with
  a bucket\, a printed cheat sheet for the fridge door\, and a standing invi
 tation to bring your kitchen scraps by any Thursday evening through the sum
 mer. No experience needed and nothing to buy. Questions beforehand? Reach u
 s at https://antiochurbang.square.site or say hello with #antiochurbangrowe
 rs.
URL:https://www.antiochurbangrowers.com/compost
END:VEVENT
